## Scope

Topics, priorities, dossier states, organization types, intake methods, question groups, tags, answer templates, geography, evidence documents, import/export and change history.

## Acceptance criteria

- Codes are unique within catalogue type and historical values remain readable.
- Deactivation blocks new selection but preserves existing records.
- Sort order and unit-specific overrides are versioned.
- Bulk import provides row-level errors and all-or-nothing commit.

